# FP unordered-family predicate end-to-end (LLVM-084t, ISS-193 (a)).
#
# Compiles tests/unit/llvm/e2e/fp_unordered_e2e.c with the DADAO clang, links it against
# the project crt0 + linker script and runs it on qemu dadao-m1 with
# semihosting.  The guest exit code is the test result: the program returns 0
# only when isnan/isinf/isfinite over NaN / +-Inf / +-0 compute the IEEE-754
# correct value for both f64 and f32 and in both value and branch form, and a
# distinct non-zero code otherwise.  qemu's process exit code is the lit result.
# RUN: %clang -target dadao-unknown-elf -nostdlib -Oz -x c -c %e2e_dir/fp_unordered_e2e.c -o %t.o
# RUN: %llvm_mc --triple=dadao-unknown-elf -filetype=obj %crt0 -o %t.crt0.o
# RUN: %ld -T %linker_script %t.crt0.o %t.o -o %t.elf
# RUN: timeout 30 %qemu -M dadao-m1 -kernel %t.elf -semihosting-config enable=on,target=native -display none -nographic
